title: "Learning to Build Momentum: Experience Replay, On-Policy Learning, and Reward Shaping in MountainCar"
type: software
authors:
  - name: MD MOBASHIR HOSSIAN SIFAT
repository-code: "https://github.com/<YOUR_GITHUB_USERNAME>/mountaincar-rl-research"
